<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT-Quinenco started outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Quinenco started outperform.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it has started coverage of Chile's firm Quinenco, the holding company of the Luksic industrial group, with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>&quot;We like Quinenco because of what we see as its excellent management team, which is capable of delivering above average returns and adding significant value to investors through returns,&quot; said the report.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it has set a target price of $22.50 per American Depositary Receipt, 25 percent over current levels.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
